WEBVTT

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:07.400
May 30th, 1431
France
Place du Vieux-Marché

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:36.680
June 2nd, Taisho 10
(June 21st, 1582)
Honnou-ji Temple, Kyoto

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:38.140
Master!
June 2nd, Taisho 10
(June 21st, 1582)
Honnou-ji Temple, Kyoto

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:40.230
Akechi Mitsuhide has betrayed us!
June 2nd, Taisho 10
(June 21st, 1582)
Honnou-ji Temple, Kyoto

00:00:40.230 --> 00:00:40.240
Akechi Mitsuhide has betrayed us!

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:41.870
Mitsuhide?!

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:46.390
Then... it was inevitable.

00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:54.050
O Lord!

00:00:55.050 --> 00:00:57.910
Let me hear Your voice!

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:13.900
Ranmaru! If there is a
world after this one,

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:16.970
then that is where we
shall gain dominion!

00:01:18.510 --> 00:01:19.820
The Savior-King...

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:34.640
In times long past,

00:01:35.380 --> 00:01:39.080
when the universe was still in chaos,

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:45.300
the known world was divided between
two stars, called East and West.

00:01:46.930 --> 00:01:51.730
The people of each star
built many cities and towns,

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:55.410
under the guidance of
the dragons' messengers.

00:01:57.310 --> 00:02:02.170
On both stars, the people looked up
at the starry expanse of heaven above

00:02:02.730 --> 00:02:07.770
and wondered what strange
lands might exist out there.

00:02:09.130 --> 00:02:12.890
Now, after countless years,

00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:17.690
the Star of the West has become the first to obtain the Dragon's Breath.

00:02:17.690 --> 00:02:22.490
It will soon unite into an empire,
under a single ruler.

00:02:24.260 --> 00:02:25.460
On the other hand,

00:02:25.460 --> 00:02:29.640
the Star of the East is still
divided into many nations,

00:02:29.640 --> 00:02:31.850
each vying for dominion over the others.

00:02:32.580 --> 00:02:33.370
One of them, ruled by the Oda Clan,

00:02:33.370 --> 00:02:35.520
Rokkaku                                     Oda                                Saitou
One of them, ruled by the Oda Clan,

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:36.070
Rokkaku                                     Oda                                Saitou

00:02:36.070 --> 00:02:37.750
has managed to survive in this war-torn era
Rokkaku                                     Oda                                Saitou

00:02:37.750 --> 00:02:38.120
Takeda
Azai
has managed to survive in this war-torn era

00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:41.360
despite being surrounded by powerful
nations seeking conquest.
Azai
Takeda

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:43.280
despite being surrounded by powerful
nations seeking conquest.

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:49.770
This is a tale of the warriors who
were born on those two stars,

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:51.770
and dreamed of conquering the world.

00:02:52.370 --> 00:02:58.370
They laughed and cried, loved and lived.
This is the proof of their existence.

00:03:03.690 --> 00:03:05.180
Ranmaru...

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:14.220
That dream again...

00:03:15.010 --> 00:03:17.660
He called me Ranmaru.

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:21.290
Who is he?

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:25.160
Nobu.

00:03:25.160 --> 00:03:26.560
Wake up, Nobu.

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:32.010
That dream again?

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:33.610
Yeah.

00:03:33.610 --> 00:03:36.380
You betrayed me, Mitsu.

00:03:36.380 --> 00:03:38.590
I dream about that a lot lately.

00:03:38.590 --> 00:03:40.020
You're lucky it's just me.

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:42.370
But if you attack everyone who wakes you up,

00:03:42.370 --> 00:03:43.620
you'll lose all your friends.

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:45.140
That's no big loss.

00:03:45.140 --> 00:03:48.020
You and the Monkey are
all the friends I need.

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:52.890
It's still a poor example for
the Oda Clan's heir to set.

00:03:54.340 --> 00:03:56.350
Setting an example? Public image?

00:03:56.350 --> 00:03:58.850
Stop talking like my shithead dad.

00:03:59.470 --> 00:04:01.270
Did you put on years lately?

00:04:02.530 --> 00:04:03.540
Perhaps.

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:07.760
But you shouldn't miss your
younger brother Nobukatsu-sama's

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:09.600
coming of age ceremony.

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:12.320
Thanks to Clan Lord Nobuhide-sama's efforts,

00:04:12.320 --> 00:04:15.530
Owari has become one of the
most powerful nations in the realm.

00:04:15.530 --> 00:04:17.390
But there still are other
warrior lords to reckon with,

00:04:17.390 --> 00:04:18.550
such as Takeda and Uesugi—

00:04:18.550 --> 00:04:21.230
Yeah, yeah, I know.

00:04:21.230 --> 00:04:25.060
How could I not know after listening
to your lectures all the time?

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:29.760
Still, I've never seen anyone
with hair that color.

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:31.250
A foreigner, maybe?

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:34.080
Sure smelled great, anyhow.

00:04:34.390 --> 00:04:35.920
Was she a beauty?

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:37.340
Well, sure.

00:04:37.340 --> 00:04:39.640
Wait, when did I say I was
talking about a woman?

00:04:40.200 --> 00:04:43.140
I can tell just by looking at your face.

00:04:43.560 --> 00:04:45.410
How long have we known each other?

00:04:45.410 --> 00:04:46.920
I see!

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:49.110
So it was written all over my face, eh?!

00:04:49.110 --> 00:04:50.500
No wonder!

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:51.600
Nobu, please!

00:04:52.110 --> 00:04:55.270
You're known by the mocking
name "Fool of Oda,"

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:57.290
because you're always acting like this.

00:04:58.350 --> 00:04:59.180
What's wrong?

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:01.000
It reeks.

00:05:02.490 --> 00:05:03.530
Nobu-sama!

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:05.620
What is it, Monkey?

00:05:05.620 --> 00:05:07.890
You ruined the yellow
mountain rose bush.

00:05:07.890 --> 00:05:09.600
Who cares about flowers?

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:10.880
Wait, that's not what I'm here for...

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:13.020
I've got way bigger news than that!

00:05:13.390 --> 00:05:15.610
You must have found
something, Hideyoshi.

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:19.050
You won't believe the prey I've found.

00:05:26.560 --> 00:05:27.650
That's a big one, all right.

00:05:28.070 --> 00:05:30.870
I ran into them when I was
scouting our hunting grounds.

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:35.060
War Armor this elaborate must belong
to Lord Takeda Shingen's forces.

00:05:35.290 --> 00:05:37.570
I wonder what their plan is!

00:05:38.030 --> 00:05:40.040
What are you so excited for, Hideyoshi?

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:43.730
If Takeda has this large of a force on
his border with our lands, it means—

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:44.710
It reeks.

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:45.920
Nobu?

00:05:46.530 --> 00:05:49.780
Skipping Nobukatsu's coming of age
ceremony was the right decision.

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:51.860
They're about to march.

00:05:52.360 --> 00:05:56.410
Let's get a close look at how
the Takeda Clan does battle.

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:00.210
Nobunaga!

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:02.130
Where is Nobunaga?

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:05.070
Katsuie, where has Nobunaga gone?

00:06:05.070 --> 00:06:06.070
My lord!

00:06:06.070 --> 00:06:09.780
He has not been seen since yesterday,
when he left to go hunting.

00:06:09.780 --> 00:06:11.230
Hunting?!

00:06:12.070 --> 00:06:15.430
Has he no respect for his younger
brother's coming of age ceremony?

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:17.910
That fool!

00:06:18.320 --> 00:06:21.550
All platoons, begin orchestration
chamber entry procedures.

00:06:21.550 --> 00:06:23.320
Proceed to seal Armor Shells.

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:24.410
All engines online.

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:29.720
Orchestration system
circuits connected.

00:06:29.720 --> 00:06:31.120
Armor controls online.

00:06:33.530 --> 00:06:35.970
1st War Armor Platoon, forward!

00:06:35.970 --> 00:06:37.630
Next, 2nd Platoon, forward!

00:06:37.630 --> 00:06:38.950
Cannon Support Units, maintain
distance from main troop divisions.

00:06:38.950 --> 00:06:40.400
3rd War Armor Platoon,
deploy to the left and fan out.
Cannon Support Units, maintain
distance from main troop divisions.

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:41.790
3rd War Armor Platoon,
deploy to the left and fan out.

00:06:41.790 --> 00:06:44.030
7th Squadron, guard the rear!

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:50.010
I didn't see any signs
of a Giant War Armor...

00:06:50.580 --> 00:06:52.730
That must mean Lord Shingen isn't here.

00:06:52.730 --> 00:06:55.580
But from the looks of it,
the war's definitely on, right?

00:06:55.580 --> 00:06:56.910
Oh, man!

00:06:56.910 --> 00:06:59.010
Real combat at last!

00:06:59.010 --> 00:07:00.150
Nope.

00:07:00.150 --> 00:07:00.780
Nobu?

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:03.150
They're just testing the waters.

00:07:05.450 --> 00:07:06.410
Monkey!

00:07:06.410 --> 00:07:09.610
The animal trail that leads to the
fortress lies is ahead on our right, no?

00:07:10.310 --> 00:07:11.560
Right!

00:07:11.870 --> 00:07:13.000
I'm going on ahead!

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:15.960
Mitsu, follow me. Go slow enough
so that Monkey won't keel over.

00:07:15.960 --> 00:07:17.570
Let's go, Onikage!

00:07:18.740 --> 00:07:19.720
Understood.

00:07:30.470 --> 00:07:31.640
I see.

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:34.430
By dropping a small-scale
decoy on the Oda,

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:38.320
they seek to test our ability
to mount an immediate response.

00:07:39.800 --> 00:07:41.590
Hey, Mitsuhide...

00:07:42.530 --> 00:07:45.830
What can they learn...
by testing the waters?

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:49.710
Our force's training, logistical preparation,
and communications methods...

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:51.120
Any of that.

00:07:51.620 --> 00:07:54.220
Who knows what a veteran like Lord Shingen

00:07:54.220 --> 00:07:57.170
could divine from this exercise?

00:07:57.170 --> 00:07:57.970
Huh.

00:08:02.140 --> 00:08:04.980
What did you just say, Nobunaga-sama?

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:07.240
I will repeat myself!

00:08:07.240 --> 00:08:10.600
Takeda War Armors are headed our way.

00:08:10.600 --> 00:08:12.390
There's roughly 20 units in all.

00:08:12.390 --> 00:08:14.720
They're backed up by about 600 infantry troops.

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:18.490
This fortress cannot hope to withstand
an assault of that magnitude.

00:08:18.490 --> 00:08:22.230
Do you expect us to take such
foolish talk seriously?

00:08:22.890 --> 00:08:25.770
Do you think I'd do all this for a joke?

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:27.910
You must retreat for now,

00:08:27.910 --> 00:08:30.240
and form a new line
of defense at Ootsu!

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:31.710
What?!

00:08:31.710 --> 00:08:34.570
You want me to abandon
a fort entrusted to me

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:36.350
by Hayashi-sama himself?

00:08:36.350 --> 00:08:39.380
How can you call yourself Oda's
heir and yet display such weakness?

00:08:40.050 --> 00:08:42.850
Should your father,
Nobuhide-sama, hear of this,

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:45.390
he will surely be aggrieved.

00:08:46.010 --> 00:08:49.390
The Fool is quite the troublemaker.

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:54.900
This fortress's defenses are impregnable.

00:08:55.140 --> 00:08:57.610
Even the might of Takeda

00:08:57.610 --> 00:09:00.870
will not be enough to let even a
lowly footpad breach our walls.

00:09:04.010 --> 00:09:04.710
Get down!

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:30.530
Oh, it's Jeanne!

00:09:30.530 --> 00:09:32.540
Demon-possessed Jeanne!

00:09:32.540 --> 00:09:34.270
Demon-possessed!

00:09:34.270 --> 00:09:35.200
Hey!

00:09:36.780 --> 00:09:40.640
Jeanne the demon, demon,
demon-possessed!

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:43.820
She's looking at us.

00:09:47.890 --> 00:09:50.390
Demon-possessed, huh...

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:53.290
It's not like I <i>want</i> to hear voices...

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:55.320
Who's there?!

00:09:56.770 --> 00:10:00.120
Razor-sharp instincts,
just as the rumors said.

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:05.970
My expectations have greatly
increased, Mademoiselle!

00:10:10.160 --> 00:10:15.580
Pleased to meet you,
Mademoiselle Jeanne Kaguya d'Arc.

00:10:16.340 --> 00:10:18.580
And... who are you?

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:23.610
I am a reputable man.

00:10:23.610 --> 00:10:27.770
I may not look it,
but I serve King Arthur.

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:29.090
King Arthur?

00:10:29.550 --> 00:10:32.250
By way of a greeting....

00:10:34.670 --> 00:10:36.350
I choose one, right?

00:10:36.830 --> 00:10:37.700
Indeed.

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:40.700
Is this The Star?

00:10:41.390 --> 00:10:46.920
This card represents the world's
inner timbre, its voice.

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:55.530
A voice speaks to you...

00:10:55.530 --> 00:10:59.350
Do you not wish to see
where it will lead you?

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:01.520
How do you know about the voice?

00:11:01.520 --> 00:11:03.270
My apologies for this belated introduction.

00:11:03.270 --> 00:11:06.360
I am Leonardo da Vinci.

00:11:06.840 --> 00:11:09.590
I want to know everything about the
Prophecy holding you its thrall,

00:11:09.590 --> 00:11:11.600
the King who will save these stars,

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:14.370
and his banquet.

00:11:15.240 --> 00:11:17.530
The King who will save us?

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:24.140
Let us go together to
the Star of the East.

00:11:42.960 --> 00:11:44.570
What is this...?

00:11:51.070 --> 00:11:52.570
So this is war.

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:44.620
The fate of the Star of the West...

00:12:45.100 --> 00:12:46.370
The Star of the East...

00:12:46.920 --> 00:12:48.350
The King who will save us...

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:52.860
Were you thinking of your home town?

00:12:53.270 --> 00:12:54.390
But come to think of it,

00:12:54.390 --> 00:12:56.330
your parents did not oppose

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:58.250
your journey to the Star
of the East, did they?

00:12:59.350 --> 00:13:01.040
I am demon-possessed.

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:04.630
They are glad to be rid of me.

00:13:05.620 --> 00:13:08.260
It's been a while, Sir Da Vinci.

00:13:08.710 --> 00:13:11.270
Ah, Admiral Magellan.

00:13:11.270 --> 00:13:15.190
I deeply appreciate your
escort on our journey.

00:13:15.470 --> 00:13:17.700
Yes, I'm aware.

00:13:17.700 --> 00:13:19.130
The purpose of this journey

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:22.060
is to test the new War Armor
you designed, is it not?

00:13:22.550 --> 00:13:23.460
Indeed.

00:13:23.460 --> 00:13:27.840
And this young lady must be
the assistant you mentioned.

00:13:28.650 --> 00:13:33.640
Although, if I may say so,
she looks more like your bodyguard.

00:13:34.520 --> 00:13:38.380
It will be my first sojourn
to the Star of the East.

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:40.920
I could not take just any
young lass under my care.

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:41.950
No matter.

00:13:42.430 --> 00:13:45.000
She serves as the model
for your work, as well, no?

00:13:45.680 --> 00:13:49.960
Launch the Giant War Armor as
may times as your tests require.

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:52.090
I thank you for your generosity.

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:56.060
We are both loyal
servants of King Arthur.

00:13:56.680 --> 00:13:58.110
Make yourself at home.

00:14:03.430 --> 00:14:07.380
The moment has come. You must
open the way to your own destiny.

00:14:09.470 --> 00:14:11.340
Has the Prophecy called for you?

00:14:11.810 --> 00:14:13.940
I have to go!

00:14:16.380 --> 00:14:18.590
I will go with you.

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:32.770
Da Vinci?!

00:14:33.130 --> 00:14:34.030
Yes?

00:14:34.030 --> 00:14:36.560
Are you sure we can take
a ship without permission?!

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:38.270
It's a bad idea, of course.

00:14:38.530 --> 00:14:39.970
But...!

00:14:39.970 --> 00:14:42.810
But you heard the voice telling
you to go right away, no?

00:14:42.810 --> 00:14:44.150
Y-Yes.

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:44.690
But...

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:45.630
Quiet, please.

00:14:45.630 --> 00:14:47.280
Or you may bite your tongue!

00:14:54.760 --> 00:14:57.720
Landing Unit Taketori has launched
without authorization!

00:14:57.720 --> 00:14:59.440
Security is not responding.

00:15:00.030 --> 00:15:02.510
The Taketori has crossed the
ley line interference belt.

00:15:05.330 --> 00:15:06.270
We're fine!

00:15:06.270 --> 00:15:08.170
The engine just got nicked a little!

00:15:08.710 --> 00:15:11.100
Ley line repulsion forces at maximum!

00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:12.670
The ship won't hold!

00:15:13.000 --> 00:15:15.140
Deploy a tracking unit!

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:16.810
Bring them back dead or alive!

00:15:17.780 --> 00:15:21.170
How am I to report this to King Arthur?

00:15:21.170 --> 00:15:24.160
What are you planning, Sir Da Vinci?

00:15:41.180 --> 00:15:43.890
Takeda's forces seem
to have cleared out.

00:15:44.430 --> 00:15:47.510
As you thought, Nobu,
they were just testing the waters.

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:49.910
This was a test?

00:15:49.910 --> 00:15:51.910
You mean it was a massacre, right?

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:56.310
It's said that Takeda possesses
several Giant War Armor units.

00:15:56.840 --> 00:15:59.520
Who knows how our forces
actually compare to his?

00:16:00.470 --> 00:16:01.520
Hideyoshi!

00:16:02.090 --> 00:16:04.540
Looting a battlefield's dead is unseemly.

00:16:04.890 --> 00:16:08.430
It's not like the previous
owners care anymore.

00:16:08.430 --> 00:16:10.570
I'll make good use of them.

00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:16.190
Nobu-sama?

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:19.240
Nobu?

00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:20.270
Damn it!

00:16:20.270 --> 00:16:21.780
We lost.

00:16:21.780 --> 00:16:23.050
We lost big time!

00:16:24.200 --> 00:16:25.570
Pull yourself together.

00:16:25.950 --> 00:16:27.780
Just listen to yourself.

00:16:28.300 --> 00:16:30.200
Why bother?

00:16:30.200 --> 00:16:32.290
I saw it happen with my own eyes!

00:16:32.600 --> 00:16:34.320
This is war!

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:36.930
The war of a new era!

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:39.300
How can I <i>not</i> laugh?

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:44.070
Nobu.

00:16:45.570 --> 00:16:48.380
Mitsu, am I laughing?

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:50.570
Or, am I crying?

00:16:54.960 --> 00:16:56.160
Both.

00:16:57.740 --> 00:16:59.820
Hold on tight, Jeanne!

00:17:06.210 --> 00:17:08.320
A falling star...

00:17:12.280 --> 00:17:15.790
Is it a good omen... or an ill omen?

00:17:19.060 --> 00:17:20.170
A falling star!

00:17:22.670 --> 00:17:25.240
There you are, Ichihime-sama.

00:17:25.240 --> 00:17:26.440
It's not safe here!

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:27.740
A star has fallen.

00:17:27.740 --> 00:17:28.530
I'm scared.

00:17:28.530 --> 00:17:30.710
I think something bad will happen.

00:17:30.710 --> 00:17:31.920
That's not true, Gou.

00:17:31.920 --> 00:17:33.330
A falling star will make your wishes come true.
Nobu...

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:34.180
A falling star will make your wishes come true.

00:17:35.660 --> 00:17:37.810
I wish that we were not leaving
the fallen upon the battlefield

00:17:37.810 --> 00:17:40.950
and that we could at least honor
them with a flower or two.

00:17:40.950 --> 00:17:42.190
What else can we do?

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:47.320
We can only bring news of
this defeat back to the castle.

00:17:48.430 --> 00:17:51.610
That only makes my desire to
bring change even greater.

00:17:53.030 --> 00:17:54.010
Nobu...

00:17:54.700 --> 00:17:56.740
When the nature of war changes,
the times change with it.

00:17:57.500 --> 00:17:59.840
We can't just sit back
and watch it pass us by.

00:18:00.980 --> 00:18:03.070
If a new era is upon us,

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:06.100
I want to be right in the
middle of the turmoil!

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:08.840
I'm not going to run away!

00:18:10.570 --> 00:18:11.450
I'm with you!

00:18:12.020 --> 00:18:13.060
Monkey...

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:16.550
I will go with you, Nobu-sama.

00:18:16.550 --> 00:18:20.530
I will create a huge storm
in the midst of your turmoil!

00:18:20.530 --> 00:18:21.300
Great!

00:18:23.860 --> 00:18:25.240
That's no fun.

00:18:26.320 --> 00:18:27.370
Mitsu?

00:18:28.410 --> 00:18:30.630
Don't tell me you intend to enjoy

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:34.380
such a noble game by yourselves.

00:18:35.580 --> 00:18:37.010
Count me in.

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:44.310
I guess we don't have a choice!

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:50.990
The three of us will change the world!

00:18:53.530 --> 00:18:55.200
We can do this!

00:18:57.950 --> 00:19:00.770
The word of a samurai cannot be revoked!

00:19:05.840 --> 00:19:11.010
Look! That falling star
bears witness to our vows.

00:19:12.720 --> 00:19:13.520
Huh?

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:17.030
Hmm, maybe I'm just imagining it, but...

00:19:17.030 --> 00:19:21.650
No, I think it's coming closer, too.

00:19:21.650 --> 00:19:23.000
That's the ticket!

00:19:23.000 --> 00:19:26.560
This star's ballsy enough
to come right at us!

00:19:38.410 --> 00:19:40.260
That's a falling star?

00:19:40.260 --> 00:19:41.300
No.

00:19:41.300 --> 00:19:44.130
It seems man-made.

00:19:44.580 --> 00:19:49.450
Could this be one of the Western
star-ships I've heard about?

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:52.090
Nobu, where are you going?

00:19:52.090 --> 00:19:53.460
You don't know what might happen!

00:19:53.950 --> 00:19:56.220
What more could happen now?

00:19:56.220 --> 00:20:00.600
We won't find out more
unless we get closer to it.

00:20:01.560 --> 00:20:02.980
What's the matter, Nobu?

00:20:02.980 --> 00:20:04.310
I'm fine!

00:20:05.000 --> 00:20:05.930
This scent...

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:10.240
Is someone there?!

00:20:11.610 --> 00:20:12.670
Nobu-sama!
Nobu!

00:20:15.210 --> 00:20:16.480
Hey, you!

00:20:17.540 --> 00:20:18.810
Wake up!

00:20:34.630 --> 00:20:37.950
Increasing sensitivity of
gravity balancer by .03 m/s².

00:20:37.950 --> 00:20:39.040
Roger.

00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:40.670
Falco Uno, andare.

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:42.500
Falco Due, andare.

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:47.400
Mitsuhide, it's too dangerous.

00:20:47.400 --> 00:20:49.010
Let go! Nobu's in there!

00:21:03.000 --> 00:21:05.020
Opening up with a cannon salvo?

00:21:05.020 --> 00:21:06.700
That's rich!

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:10.230
Listen well, you who are guided
by the fate of the stars.

00:21:10.680 --> 00:21:14.870
Only the true Savior-King can
breathe life into this armor.

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:16.540
The Savior-King?

00:21:21.990 --> 00:21:24.770
The fate... of the stars...

00:21:26.600 --> 00:21:29.270
I have no idea what's
going on, but sure!

00:21:30.540 --> 00:21:33.660
Giant War Armor, from now on,

00:21:33.660 --> 00:21:35.520
you will be...

00:21:36.220 --> 00:21:38.660
as my own flesh and blood!

00:21:42.750 --> 00:21:45.030
The Fool has awakened.

00:21:46.050 --> 00:21:47.770
How wonderful!

00:21:49.910 --> 00:21:51.770
The time has come.

00:22:17.190 --> 00:22:18.690
The Savior-King...

00:22:38.110 --> 00:22:39.680
It was inevitable!

00:24:11.510 --> 00:24:13.250
In this era of chaos,

00:24:13.250 --> 00:24:15.720
only those with great resolve

00:24:15.720 --> 00:24:16.790
will live to see the dawn.

00:24:17.820 --> 00:24:19.760
Will you be able to stay by my side?

00:24:20.710 --> 00:24:22.720
Next Time: The Lovers.

00:24:23.260 --> 00:24:24.650
It was inevitable.
